Note on spaces. so400m-s30k and so400m-full were distilled against
emb_train2017_SO400M-pca512{_s30000,} - `mu` and `w` compare bit-identical,
so _s30000 subsets the training images and not the PCA fit, and the teacher
and pca rows above are the same numbers for both. The two -a05 runs use
emb_train2017_SO400M-pca512-a0.5{,_s30000}, a differently whitened basis
whose pca 512 ceiling is 0.816 rather than 0.825.

so400m-full-a05 is the checkpoint the board flashes.
